     A long time ago in the early days of wanderer I created
a  screen  that  I  thought  was reasonably difficult.  This
screen had been tested on some  of  the  local  players  and
after  fixing it up a bit I felt it was a good challenge.  I
sent this screen  in  to  Steven  Shipway  so  it  could  be
included  in his next release and to my surprise it was :-).
It is screen 36.

     My problem is that I have recently  loaded  the  latest
version  of  wanderer  onto  our system here and things have
changed.  There are all the neat new things that  have  been
added  like  balloons  and  so  on  which  is great.  But it
appears that the rules for arrows  and  falling  rocks  have
been  changed slightly.  These last changes have resulted in
making screen 36 very easy to solve :-(.

     So in the interest of keeping the challenge in the game
I  have  included  two  small changes below which return the
screen to the way it was intended.  This changed screen will
still work under the older version of wanderer as well.

     Have fun!

